repository-code: "https://github.com/DenysKachalenko/CPP26FieldEnumerationCompileCostArtifact"
abstract: >-
  Generator, measurement harness, raw data of three measurement sessions on GCC 16.2.0
  (with GCC 16.1.0 alongside), and the analysis that regenerates every number and figure
  of the paper: the compile-time cost of enumerating the fields of a struct with C++26
  static reflection (P2996, P3394), structured-binding packs (P1061), the reflection
  libraries Boost.PFR, reflect-cpp and Glaze, X-macros and hand-written serializers.
keywords:
  - C++26
  - static reflection
  - P2996
  - compile time
  - serialization
  - GCC
